    description: "Pass 17 finding AAAAAA. Of 28225 nodes with non-null fingerprint, 99 nodes (ALL from packages/hypergumbo-tracker/pyproject.toml dependency declarations) carry raw 16-char hex strings as fingerprint (e.g. 'e6dd6c56c5bd48c6') instead of the canonical 'hgfp1:<hash>' format used by the other 28126 nodes. Sample id: 'toml:packages/hypergumbo-tracker/pyproject.toml:24-24:rich:dependency' fp='e6dd6c56c5bd48c6'. Schema declares one scheme, two formats are emitted."  # 904c
    fields:  # 904c
      statement: "All emitted node.fingerprint values must use the canonical 'hgfp1:<hash>' format declared by symbol_fingerprint_scheme='hypergumbo-symbol-fp-v1'."  # 904c
      root_cause: "TOML dependency extraction path emits raw hex hashes without the 'hgfp1:' prefix; canonical format helper is bypassed in this code path."  # 904c
